<p class="lt-chem-151883">\[\frac{152 \: \mu \text{g}}{\mathrm{mL}} \times \frac{100.0 \: \mathrm{mL}}{5.00 \: \mathrm{mL}} \times \frac{1 \:\mathrm{mg}}{1000 \: \mu \mathrm{g}}=3.04 \: \mathrm{mg} / \mathrm{mL} \nonumber\]</p>

