<section class="box-exercise"><header><div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/Analytical_Chemistry/Analytical_Chemistry_2.1_(Harvey)/13:_Kinetic_Methods/13.02:_Chemical_Kinetics" class="mt-section"><span id="Exercise_13.2.3"></span><h5 id="Exercise_13.2.3-151883"><span class="lt-icon-default">Exercise 13.2.3
